# Paths Semgrep should not scan. Same spirit as .gitignore but for SAST.
# Semgrep already skips .gitignore'd paths; this file adds project-specific
# noise reducers. Keep it SHORT — every exclusion is a blind spot.

# Build output and third-party code
dist/
node_modules/
coverage/

# Tests: they intentionally send malformed input and fake credentials, which
# triggers rules that are correct for production code but noisy here.
test/

# Lockfiles and docs
package-lock.json
docs/
*.md
